cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "12Q-VQE: Ab Initio C17 Quantum Chemistry, Adjoint VQE, and Sample-Based Quantum Diagonalization Engine"
message: "If you use 12Q-VQE in your research or software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
