  - c17
abstract: >-
  12Q-VQE (libqchem / qchem_vqe) is a standalone C17 and OpenMP/BLAS-accelerated
  quantum chemistry and hybrid quantum-classical simulation engine. It implements
  arbitrary Cartesian Gaussian basis integrals with Boys-function recurrence,
  DIIS-accelerated Restricted Hartree-Fock (RHF), active-space MP2 natural orbital
  selection, standard FCIDUMP and XYZ interoperability, Jordan-Wigner UCCSD,
  reverse-mode analytical adjoint gradients with L-BFGS and ADAPT-VQE,
  Sample-Based Quantum Diagonalization (SQD / QSCI) with self-consistent
  configuration recovery, and direct OpenQASM 2.0 / IBM Quantum Runtime REST execution.
